<figure class="chapter-visual function-functional-map">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：函数与泛函的定义域和值域</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: domains and codomains of a function and a functional</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="function-functional-title function-functional-desc">
    <title id="function-functional-title">Function and functional mapping diagram</title>
    <desc id="function-functional-desc">
      A function maps one point x in a domain to one value f of x. A functional takes an entire admissible function and maps it to a scalar.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="map-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="function-functional-map__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(24 34)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="78" rx="10" class="function-functional-map__box" />
      <text x="75" y="31" text-anchor="middle">point x ∈ Ω</text>
      <text x="75" y="55" text-anchor="middle">定义域中的点</text>
      <line x1="166" y1="39" x2="282" y2="39" marker-end="url(#map-arrow)" class="function-functional-map__arrow" />
      <text x="224" y="27" text-anchor="middle">f</text>
      <rect x="298" y="0" width="150" height="78" rx="10" class="function-functional-map__box" />
      <text x="373" y="31" text-anchor="middle">value f(x)</text>
      <text x="373" y="55" text-anchor="middle">一个函数值</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(24 160)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="250" height="86" rx="10" class="function-functional-map__box" />
      <path d="M22 62 C62 8, 104 75, 144 30 S218 70, 228 24" class="function-functional-map__curve" />
      <text x="125" y="18" text-anchor="middle">whole admissible function f(·) ∈ X</text>
      <text x="125" y="80" text-anchor="middle">函数空间中的完整元素</text>
      <line x1="266" y1="43" x2="382" y2="43" marker-end="url(#map-arrow)" class="function-functional-map__arrow" />
      <text x="324" y="31" text-anchor="middle">F</text>
      <rect x="398" y="0" width="180" height="86" rx="10" class="function-functional-map__box" />
      <text x="488" y="34" text-anchor="middle">scalar F[f] ∈ ℝ</text>
      <text x="488" y="61" text-anchor="middle">一个标量</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <dl class="function-functional-map__fallback">
    <div>
      <dt>函数 | Function</dt>
      <dd><code>f: Ω → ℝ</code>，输入一个点 <code>x</code>，输出一个数 <code>f(x)</code>。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>泛函 | Functional</dt>
      <dd><code>F: X → ℝ</code>，输入函数空间 <code>X</code> 中的一整个函数，输出一个数 <code>F[f]</code>。</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>先区分输入对象，避免把普通导数 <code>df/dx</code> 和泛函导数 <code>δF/δf</code> 当作同一层次的对象。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> distinguish the input objects before comparing an ordinary derivative <code>df/dx</code> with a functional derivative <code>δF/δf</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图和语义列表都必须给出定义域和值域；关闭 JavaScript 后全部信息仍可读。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> both the diagram and semantic list state domains and codomains; all information remains available without JavaScript.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>示意图不指定函数空间的正则性、范数或边界条件；这些信息必须由具体变分问题补充。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the diagram does not choose regularity, a norm, or boundary conditions for the function space; a concrete variational problem must supply them.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

